:''Not to be confused with [[Oldstrich]].''
'''M. Ost''' (オールドリー, ''Ōrudorī'', '''Oldrey''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[R.Ost]] that first appears in [[Uncanny Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

