==Trivia==
*The "M" could stand for [[wikipedia:Shades of green#Moss green|moss]] (a shade of green associated with [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]]), ''[[wikipedia:Manzai|manzai]]'' (a traditional Japanese style of comedy mentioned in M. Ost's Japanese description), or 緑 ''midori'' (green).
*His Japanese name, Ōrudorī (オールドリー, "Oldrey") may be derived from オールド ''ōrudo'' (old), 鳥 ''tori'' (bird), 緑 ''midori'' (green) and オードリー ''Ōdorī'' ([[:wikipedia:Audrey (owarai)|Audrey]], a ''manzai'' comedy duo).
*Just like [[R.Ost]], if you pay attention to M. Ost's attack animation, you'll notice he doesn't have multi-hit, and as such only one attack does damage while the other is his backswing.

